# Tests

- pytest + pytest-django + factory_boy; PostgreSQL only (`docker compose up -d db`).
- Mark DB tests with `pytestmark = pytest.mark.django_db`.
- Use factories from `apps/<app>/tests/factories.py` via `Factory.create(...)` or
  `Factory.build(...)` (typed return values). `ListingFactory.create(published=True)` and
  `room=True` traits exist.
- Every permission rule: one allowed and one denied test. Every filter: a test proving it narrows
  results. Every lifecycle transition: valid and invalid cases.
- Use the `client` fixture and `client.force_login(user)` for view tests; assert status codes and
  `response.context`, not HTML details.
- Emails: `django.core.mail.outbox` (locmem backend in test settings).
